ay to reunite with her: to change her face and return to that house as someone else. On this journey, she meets the successful plastic surgeon Barış Saygıner, and on the operating table, he rewrites not only her face but also her destiny. However, the shadows of the past and an impossible love will be Azra's greatest test.\r\n\r\n","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":9}],"value":9,"age":"TV-MA"},"background_color":"#8f1919","current_season_id":22219,"content_control":"FAMILY"}}